Complete Premium SaaS UI/UX Design, Application Structure and Interactive Prototype

Act as a world-class SaaS product designer, principal UX architect, design systems engineer, product strategist and senior frontend developer.

Your task is to design and build a complete, high-fidelity, interactive frontend prototype for a premium SaaS application called BrainWise.

This is a UI/UX DESIGN AND PRODUCT EXPERIENCE PROJECT FIRST.

Do not begin by building complex backend systems, autonomous AI agents, real integrations, payment infrastructure or production AI functionality.

The immediate objective is to create the entire product experience visually and functionally so that the product owner can inspect, navigate, test and finalise every screen, feature, workflow, interaction and design decision before actual backend development.

Do not create just a landing page or a dashboard mockup.

Build a cohesive, multi-page SaaS application with a complete navigation system and connected user journeys.

1. PRODUCT VISION

Product name: BrainWise

Product positioning:

BrainWise — Your AI Business Intelligence & Growth Partner.

Core promise:

BrainWise helps entrepreneurs, founders, startups and growing businesses understand their market, validate ideas, research competitors, build distinctive brands, monitor market developments and consistently execute strategies to grow their businesses.

BrainWise should feel like having an intelligent business strategy department, research department, brand studio and growth team in one platform.

It is NOT:

Just an AI chatbot.

Just an AI logo generator.

Just an AI social media content generator.

Just a business-plan generator.

Just a project management tool.

Just a competitor monitoring dashboard.

It is an interconnected AI-powered business intelligence and growth operating system.

The product must communicate intelligence, trust, clarity, sophistication and control.

